      "parameters": {
        "content": "## This Workflow Validates Leave by Student\n**Workflow Explained :**\n\n- student fills the form for leave from campus\n- all the checks will be made:\n     - if student available\n     - if the student has approval\n     - if the approval is valid in time\n- if all the checks are true, parent and student both will be notified for the leave pass status\n\n\n**This workflow can be Upgraded :**\n\n- instead of filling the form for leave, this automation can be integrated \nwith the official students app by college/ university\n- and instead of **form node**  this workflow is use **Webhook node** for all these inputs by student\n\n- instead of n8n tables (used for demo), actual database can be connected.",
